  "notes": "Datasheet SNAS545D. Reference variant LM386N-1/LM386M-1; LM386N-3 (POUT 500/700 mW @9V) and LM386N-4 (VS 5-18 V, POUT 700/1000 mW @16V, ABS_MAX VCC 22 V, RECOMMENDED VCC 5-18 V) rows and LM386MM-1 package dissipation (0.595 W) are excluded. Two pins are both named 'GAIN' (pins 1 and 8) in the pin table; stored as GAIN1/GAIN8 with alias 'GAIN'. Pin figure caption reads 'D Package 8-Pin MSOP' (datasheet error; D is SOIC). Pin table TYPE for GAIN is '–' (stored BIDIRECTIONAL), BYPASS is 'O' (role BIAS, direction OUTPUT). The 'VS Operating Supply Voltage' row appears in the Electrical Characteristics table (tagged ELECTRICAL) although it duplicates RECOMMENDED. THD printed '0.2%' -> typ 0.2 unit %. Electrical table header says 'over operating free-air temperature range' with no explicit TA=25°C. Only timing-type spec is BW 300 kHz (no slew rate / turn-on time tabulated). ESD table is a 2017+ addition; ABS_MAX lacks TJ/soldering rows in this revision. Text file contains control chars."
